    "text": "Declaration of Determination of the Commissioner of Title Settlement under Section 14 BY virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 14 of the Registration of Title Act, No.21 of 1998, I, the undersigned, hereby declare my determination as set out in the Schedule appended hereto in regard to the title to parcel of Land No. 1 : 20 of Block 4, contained in the Cadastral Map No. 420042, situated in the Village of Talakolahena within the Grama Niladhari Division of No. 301 - Nabadewa in the Divisional Secretary's Division of Nikaweratiya, in the District of Kurunegala, in the Province of North Western, referred to in Notice No. 42/0799 calling for claims to land parcels which was duly published in the Gazette No. 2269/24 of 02nd March, 2022 in terms of Section 12 of the Registration of Title Act, No.21 of 1998. P. C. D. SIGERA, Commissioner General of Land Title Settlement. Land Title Settlement Department, No. 1200/6, \u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla, 24th July, 2024.",
